{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "For documentation (U1), use Markdown format and store in the project's documentation directory for easy access and version control.",
    "For test enhancements (U2-U6), utilize JUnit 5 and Mockito for unit tests, and Spring Test with Testcontainers for integration tests to ensure robustness.",
    "For bug fix (U7), analyze the provided stream definition issue and modify the Admin UI shutdown controller to handle JDBC and HDFS interactions correctly.",
    "For feature (U8), design a configuration property-based approach to specify multiple binders, ensuring backward compatibility and flexible data routing."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The project is a Spring Cloud Data Flow (s-c-d) application with existing SPI implementations for Lattice, CC, and YARN, and I have access to the codebase.",
    "Development environment is set up with Java 17+, Maven/Gradle, and necessary dependencies as per Spring Framework 6.0 requirements.",
    "CI pipeline (e.g., Jenkins or GitHub Actions) is already configured for automated test execution, so integration with CI is straightforward.",
    "The bug in U7 is reproducible with the given stream definition and does not require changes to underlying libraries beyond the Admin UI and stream processing logic.",
    "For U8, the implementation will focus on spring-cloud-stream binder configurations and will not involve major architectural changes."
  ],
